## ⚡ Recommended Strategy

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Phase 1 first (fast, high impact). Phase 2 only if still needed.**

### Phase 1: Fix the Existing System (1-2 hours)

These changes will have **immediate, dramatic impact** on your agents:

#### 1A. Upgrade agent models

Replace the free models with capable ones. Here's a balanced cost/quality tier:

```yaml
# Recommended model upgrades in .paperclip.yaml
ceo-agent:       anthropic/claude-sonnet-4       # Best planner
yc-scout:        google/gemini-2.5-pro            # Good at research
trend-mapper:    google/gemini-2.5-pro            # Strong reasoning
idea-scorer:     google/gemini-2.5-flash          # Adequate for scoring
kill-switch:     google/gemini-2.5-flash          # Adequate for binary decisions
product-architect: google/gemini-2.5-pro          # Needs strong planning
cto-agent:       anthropic/claude-sonnet-4        # Technical planning
coder-agent:     anthropic/claude-sonnet-4        # Code generation
designer-agent:  google/gemini-2.5-pro            # Design reasoning
landing-page-agent: anthropic/claude-sonnet-4     # Code generation
growth-agent:    google/gemini-2.5-flash          # Marketing copy
```

**Budget-friendly alternative** (still much better than free):
```yaml
# All agents on one reliable model
all agents: google/gemini-2.5-flash   # $0.15/1M input, supports function calling
```

#### 1B. Fix Windows `run_bash_command` tool

Change [tool-executor.ts](file:///c:/Users/acer/Codeing/The_Clip_Project-/packages/adapter-utils/src/tool-executor.ts#L140-L163) to detect Windows and use PowerShell:

```typescript
// Before: exec(command)  ← uses cmd.exe on Windows
// After:  exec(command, { shell: 'powershell.exe' }) on Windows
```

#### 1C. Improve the system prompt

The default prompt `"You are agent {{agent.id}} ({{agent.name}}). Continue your Paperclip work."` is too vague. A stronger prompt will dramatically improve planning quality even with cheaper models.

